It also looks like you can do this:

$wgCaptchaTriggers['edit'] = true;
$wgCaptchaTriggersOnNamespace[NS_TRANSLATIONS]['edit'] = false;

Then, edits on basic pages will require reCAPTCHA, but edits to 
translations will not require reCAPTCHA.
(To the best of my knowledge, that is what will happen; the Wiki will be 
slightly more secure that way).

